    <string name="terminal_tips">Terminal tips</string>
    <string name="terminal_tips_content">The shell runs as the 3-Shell Terminal app user (not as AutoJs6) with its own home directory (%1$s). The key bar provides Esc / Tab / Ctrl / Alt and the cursor keys, a long press on the screen selects text, and the menu copies or shares the transcript. node and npm become available once a Node.js Runtime plugin with terminal support is installed. Leaving the terminal keeps the session and its processes running in the background (with a notification); \"Close session\" in the menu ends it.</string>
